WEBVTT

00:06:28.236 --> 00:06:31.636
teachers, presidents,
shareholders, chief executives,

00:06:31.636 --> 00:06:34.276
scientists, employees, mums and dads,

00:06:34.316 --> 00:06:37.556
everyone on Earth
is a citizen on this planet.

00:06:38.036 --> 00:06:40.156
So now's the time to stand up.

00:06:40.196 --> 00:06:42.356
With the courage of your convictions,

00:06:42.396 --> 00:06:44.596
raise your voices yet again

00:06:44.636 --> 00:06:47.036
and demand our leaders to take action

00:06:47.036 --> 00:06:50.356
on the promise of a 1.5 degree world.

00:06:50.396 --> 00:06:54.116
Friends, it's time to make
some serious noise

00:06:54.156 --> 00:06:55.796
to transform our world.

00:06:56.116 --> 00:06:58.836
Right now, there's another young girl,

00:06:58.836 --> 00:07:01.796
maybe it's Kolu, maybe it's Aisha,
maybe it's Fatima,